# WHAT THE IMAGE DOES NOT NEED.
#
# node_modules is installed inside the build stage from the lock file; a copied tree would be a
# second install that can differ from the first. dist/ is built in the image, so a local build must
# not leak in. The rest is repository furniture: git history, CI files, docs, the release archive.
node_modules
dist
.git
.github
*.zip
*.sha256

# Local and OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
